{"unit_id":"GooodWei__arcana#card-zh","repo":"GooodWei/arcana","commit":"82f910c0b5e645c65c2a34be0b0e47035d0489a7","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Arcana 是 DSH Web 客户端的悬浮斜杠命令面板。它通过 shell.overlay 插槽显示命令甲板，并从 remote.commands 获取当前会话可用的命令。用户可以查看命令说明和参数提示、点击运行命令、为需要参数的命令输入内容，并按使用次数排序和分页浏览；面板还支持拖动、折叠及中英文界面。适合希望从常驻面板快速发现和调用 DSH 命令的 Web 用户。无需额外 API 密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:196-235","lib/client.js:261-281","lib/client.js:327-410","lib/client.js:413-433"]}
{"unit_id":"GooodWei__arcana#card-en","repo":"GooodWei/arcana","commit":"82f910c0b5e645c65c2a34be0b0e47035d0489a7","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Arcana adds a floating slash-command deck to the DSH Web client. It lists current-session commands, shows descriptions and argument hints, and runs commands on click. Users can enter arguments, sort by usage, page through commands, and drag or collapse the panel. It supports Chinese and English.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:196-235","lib/client.js:261-281","lib/client.js:327-410","lib/client.js:413-433"]}
